        <locale name="quiqqer/tags:types/tag-search.title">
<en><![CDATA[Tag Search]]></en>
        </locale>
        <locale name="quiqqer/tags:types/tag-search.description" html="true">
<en><![CDATA[
            The tag search allows users to find content on various relevant topics without having to enter search terms themselves.
            These topics can be defined as tags by the site operator for each subpage as desired.
            The user can perform the tag search with one or more selected tags to narrow down the results more precisely.
            The results list displays all subpages that are internally marked with the tags you are looking for.
            The tag search can be configured in the settings by the site operator,
            for example to preselect certain tags or to adjust the display.
            ]]></en>
        </locale>

